#: app/templates/app/landing.html:1006
msgid ""
"Pick the repositories it may see — permissions are granular and its tokens "
"expire within the hour. Write access is asked for only when you open a fix. "
"GitLab, including self-hosted on internal networks, connects with a token."
msgstr ""
"Выберите, какие репозитории ему видны: права гранулярные, токены живут не "
